<% content_for :title, "Styleguide" %>

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
  <h1 class="text-hero">Styleguide</h1>
  <p>This database cannot draw the styleguide, because it holds no:</p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
    <% @missing.each do |record| %>
      <li><%= record %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>

  <p>Either it was never seeded, or the seed is older than the page or old enough that its ongoing event has ended. <code>bin/rails db:seed:replant</code> seeds it, and replaces every record in the database to do so.</p>
</div>
